            <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="students-life-clubs" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="clubs-tab">
              <div class="row g-4">

                <div class="col-lg-12" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="300">
                  <div class="tab-content-text">
                    <h4 style="color: var(--accent-color);">Welcome</h4>
                    <h3>Join a Community That Shares Your Interests</h3>
                    <p>Welcome to the Division of Student Affairs, UNIVERSITY OF AGRICULTURE AND ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE (UAES), UMUAGWO, Owerri.</p>

                    <p>We are dedicated to supporting your academic success, personal growth, and well-being throughout
                      your time at UNIVERSITY OF AGRICULTURE AND ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE (UAES), UMUAGWO.</p>

                    <p>Our team of vibrant and dedicated staff is committed to creating a vibrant and inclusive campus
                      community that fosters learning and development.</p>


                    <div class="row g-3 mt-4">
                      <div class="col-lg-12">
                        <div class="club-category">
                          <div class="icon-box">
                            <i class="bi bi-bullseye"></i> <!-- Mission: Target icon -->
                          </div>
                          <div class="content">
                            <h5>Mission Statement</h5>
                            <p>Empowering students to achieve academic success, personal growth and professional
                              development through inclusive, supportive, and transformative experiences.</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>

                      <div class="col-lg-12">
                        <div class="club-category">
                          <div class="icon-box">
                            <i class="bi bi-eye"></i> <!-- Vision: Eye icon -->
                          </div>
                          <div class="content">
                            <h5>Vision</h5>
                            <p>To be a leader in student affairs, cultivating compassionate, informed, and engaged
                              global citizens.</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>

                      <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="club-category">
                          <div class="icon-box">
                            <i class="bi bi-people"></i> <!-- About Us: People icon -->
