                            <h5>About Us</h5>
                            <p>The Division fosters a vibrant campus community, providing resources, services, and
                              programmes that enhance student life, learning, and well-being.</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>

                      <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="club-category">
                          <div class="icon-box">
                            <i class="bi bi-telephone"></i> <!-- Contact Information: Telephone icon -->
                          </div>
