                            <h5>Contact Information</h5>
                            <p>The Division can be contacted through the Dean, Dr. Paul Saint Christopher on 08038942589
                            </p>
                            <p>E-mail: cpaul@UISTO.edu.ng</p>
                            <p>stpaulchristopher@gmail.com</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>


                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-explore mt-4 w-50 text-nowrap">Go Home <i
                        class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>

